{"reviewId": "1107725_8bC5wW2d6", "review": {"abstract": "这实际上就是所谓的康波衰退的冲击，而这种冲击一般集中于康波衰退期，但在第四次康波中，冲击贯穿了整个衰退和萧条期", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "弱弱的说一句，其实吧，还是观察的时间太短，周期长了话，因为太过复杂，变化太多，又有一堆共性和特例，你想掌握规律，最后规律说，基本就是毫无规律，或者说，你们压根都还没找关键所在，却自以为是，一会给这打个补丁，一会给那打个补丁。刘慈欣《球状闪电》中前苏联对球状闪电，举国几十年，都是在错误的假设下，不断的调整实验参数，最后还是没研究出国所以然，能激发球状闪电，就像是运气，实则是没掌握问题的本质和规律。至于康波的研究，我想，很可能也是如此。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "author": {"userVid": 1107725, "name": "原则群主", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEKrMibiaLThibAiaiaiaJyY81hTnZINIwKcXy8lPmgjC1IMtWHrc1PQmWdVgSnAGYRnSfy03YHd5TibiaVH9d53915FapKXUbiav1JkibPq6aNMmnZ6PIAg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "内容生产者丨长期主义者丨徒步丨朗读丨定投", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "V：916334165欢迎来到我的读书道场，重复的递归是迭代～", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-1000", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "荐书领航员", "levelIndex": 1000}}, "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 0, "range": "7829-7884", "createTime": 1787622081, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "1107725_8bC5wW2d6", "userVid": 1107725, "topics": [], "userEditTime": 1787753944, "flag": 0, "pictures": [{"height": 2220, "name": "178676", "type": "BOOK", "url": "https://weread-picture-1258476243.file.myqcloud.com/25/DhYG6ZGJyBZN56674u.jpeg", "width": 1125}], "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 11, "likes": [{"userVid": 597413452, "name": "Ustinian", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.c